{"4266020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Welcome Demon", "steam_appid": 4266020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4782810], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266020/extras/653fdd1f51cda0ad400c78050408516a.avif?t=1787351721\" width=1560 height=151 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are the Warden, and this is your penance. Each day, you will judge a new soul, decipher their needs, and assign them to one of six unique dungeons. But with limited space and a web of dangerous demonic politics, every choice is a strategic puzzle. Your survival depends not just on your judgment, but on your ability to manage the delicate, chaotic ecosystem of the damned.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266020/extras/1976f434e61ec01a97410705f850231d.poster.avif?t=1787351721\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266020/extras/1976f434e61ec01a97410705f850231d.webm?t=1787351721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266020/extras/1976f434e61ec01a97410705f850231d.mp4?t=1787351721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266020/extras/dce509338364cd3fd5b16bd15c7f3142.avif?t=1787351721\" width=1560 height=151 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is more than a simple choice of good or evil. Each demon has a nature—a preference for darkness, a need for silence, or a lust for chaos. Listen to their stories and consult your ancient ledger to find their one perfect placement. A correct assignment brings order. A mistake brings you one step closer to ruin.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266020/extras/dc4112f8f1b5a2582e197f1fb1063a67.poster.avif?t=1787351721\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266020/extras/dc4112f8f1b5a2582e197f1fb1063a67.webm?t=1787351721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266020/extras/dc4112f8f1b5a2582e197f1fb1063a67.mp4?t=1787351721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266020/extras/cc1847be6d159807ef6558d743ab5068.avif?t=1787351721\" width=1560 height=151 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The souls that stand before you are not just entries in a book; they are voices filled with secrets, lies, and half-truths. Interrogate them to uncover their true nature and the events that led them to your desk. Some will beg, some will threaten, but all of them are bound to your judgment.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266020/extras/4360e7f0c3cbc52f98de193734a6e0b7.poster.avif?t=1787351721\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266020/extras/4360e7f0c3cbc52f98de193734a6e0b7.webm?t=1787351721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266020/extras/4360e7f0c3cbc52f98de193734a6e0b7.mp4?t=1787351721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266020/extras/bd4b5664d6204776a1362f0063e0ceae.avif?t=1787351721\" width=1560 height=149 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your decisions have consequences that ripple through the facility. Placing rival demons together will fuel the <strong>Chaos</strong> in your mind. Overloading a chamber will raise the <strong>Temperature</strong> to catastrophic levels. With limited slots and a clock that never stops ticking, every single placement is a critical move in your own game of survival.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266020/extras/4360e7f0c3cbc52f98de193734a6e0b7.poster.avif?t=1787351721\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266020/extras/4360e7f0c3cbc52f98de193734a6e0b7.webm?t=1787351721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266020/extras/4360e7f0c3cbc52f98de193734a6e0b7.mp4?t=1787351721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4266020/extras/2991ee783d726e92349864dd10fde960.avif?t=1787351721\" width=1560 height=149 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do you have what it takes to manage the damned and earn your freedom? <strong>Wishlist now</strong> to be notified when the gates to the dungeon open.</h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img